<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia capex data supports budget forecast - govt.</title>
<headline>Australia capex data supports budget forecast - govt.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Tuesday the latest official data on capital expenditure supported the government's budget forecasts for business investment growth in the current fiscal year.</p>
<p>&quot;The March quarter capital expenditure survey supports the budget forecast for strong growth in business investment in 1996/97,&quot; Costello told parliament.</p>
</text>
